--- Cost measurement (never store-BR-AR-0010; a fresh, throwaway sqlite file per build) ---
Two from-clean builds, each walking all 3 eager refs (3133 total blobs scanned, summed): ~326s wall average
(329.5s / 321.6s), ~1.82 MiB (1,908,736 bytes) store file, byte-identical across both builds. Up from round 2's
single-ref ~96s / ~404 KiB, as expected: 3x the refs, plus Defect B's impl-wrapper-method scan (an extra
tree-sitter parse pass, pre-filtered to files textually containing "impl" and a &[&str]/&[String]-shaped
substring before parsing -- govbridge.code.rust_cli.impl_wrapper_candidate). Not disproportionate: still well
under the semantic/embedding layer's own ~885s single-layer cost measured earlier this run.
